tyle=1;fontColor=#5F6F7A;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=4;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="640" width="1620" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c55" value="Enforced: the Okta client (cid) decides the virtual account, and the account&amp;#x27;s grants and budgets apply.&lt;br&gt;Reporting only: X-TFY-METADATA {team, app, env} adds detail to usage reports. The caller sets it, so it never enforces anything.&lt;br&gt;Dev clients are open to everyone in Okta (no groups): a developer could pick another team&amp;#x27;s client. sub in the trace shows who made the call." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;fontColor=#13202A;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="670" width="1580" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
